## Changes

- Added a monotonic `ProcessTimer` value with start/stop/reset state and
  elapsed-time access, plus a no-argument `CommandCallback` wrapper.
- Added `RemotingCommand` process-timer and callback-list getters/setters.
- The inbound frame decoder attaches a running timer before dispatching each
  complete command. Timer and callback state remain off-wire.
- Added an invoked Java 5.5.1 fixture for null/default values, set/get identity,
  timer start/stop/reset and illegal-state branches, callback-list mutation,
  invocation count, and clearing. Added Rust unit and transport regressions.
- Java's `Stopwatch` and callback interface are represented by Rust-native
  types and `Result` errors; Java exception classes are not recreated.
- Fixture SHA-256:
  `8a7ae4f5b258cff9ad87462c5568fe363d079605c487e5327dc672d69981b4c8`.

